### List all mailboxes (creates default INBOX/SENT/DRAFT/TRASH on first call)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mailbox HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create a custom mailbox
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mailbox HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

mailboxName = Test &
label = test

### Rename / update a custom mailbox
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mailbox/{{mailboxId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

mailboxName = Work Updated &
label = work-updated

### Delete a custom mailbox (system mailboxes are rejected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/mailbox/{{mailboxId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete a system mailbox (expect error)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/mailbox/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List mails in a mailbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mailbox/{{mailboxId}}/mails?page=0&size=20 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List mails in another user's mailbox (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mailbox/99999/mails HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}